# How to Build
gcc <source_files> <main_file> -I <include_path> -o <output_name> [flags]

<source_files>: Paths to your implementation files (e.g., src/gc.c).

<main_file>: Path to your entry point (e.g., test/main.c).

-I <include_path>: Directory containing your header files (e.g., -I src).

[flags]: Crucial flags for this project:

-O0: Disables optimization to ensure pointers aren't "optimized away" into registers.

-g: Includes debug symbols for stack walking analysis.

-Wall -Wextra: Enables all compiler warnings for safer pointer math.
